  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。倾注爱心制作。大量活跃于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Villager Names 会为所有未命名的村民分配预设名称。这将适用于世界中已存在和新刷新的村民。模组内置超过 5000 个名称列表，每当检测到未命名的村民时，会随机从中选取一个。交易界面中也会显示村民的职业。此外，您还可以使用自定义名称列表，详见下文。模组提供多种配置选项，用于决定在村民交易界面上显示或隐藏哪些内容。职业名称将随游戏语言进行本地化。<br><br>该模组也能为模组添加的村民命名！如果您发现某种类似村民但未命名的实体，请告诉我，以便我将其加入列表。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 合集\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>useCustomNames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">使用自定义名称列表（位于 ./mods/villagernames/customnames.txt，以逗号分隔）。如果找到自定义名称，将忽略默认名称列表。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>useDefaultFemaleNames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在为村民命名时使用预设的女性名称列表。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>useDefaultMaleNames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在为村民命名时使用预设的男性名称列表。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>useBothCustomAndDefaultNames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">默认禁用。是否同时使用自定义和默认名称为村民命名。由于默认名称数量庞大，自定义名称可能很少被选中。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameModdedVillagers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，也会为模组添加的村民命名。如果您发现了未被命名的“村民”类实体，请通过提交 Issue 告知我，以便我将其添加进来。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showProfessionOnTradeScreen</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在村民交易界面的姓名旁显示职业。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>switchNameAndProfessionTradeScreen</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，交换村民交易界面上的姓名和职业位置。结果：- 。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideMerchantLevelTradeScreen</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在交易界面隐藏商人的等级（如新手、学徒等）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldCapitalizeNames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，模组会将自定义名称列表中的每个单词首字母大写。</span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"命令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/villagernames unname</em> - 移除所有已加载村民的名称。<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/villagernames name</em> - 为所有未命名的已加载村民分配名称。</span><br><em>/villagernames rename</em> - 为所有已加载村民重新随机分配新名称。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"描述\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">版本 2.0 新增了自定义名称列表：</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首次加载模组时，它会在您的 .minecraft 文件夹下的 /config/villagernames/ 目录中生成一个名为 \"customnames.txt\" 的文件。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/villager-names/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"258\" height=\"213\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以向此列表添加任意数量的名称。只需确保它们之间用逗号分隔即可（换行非必需）。&nbsp;<strong>请确保配置文件中的 \"useCustomNames\" 已启用</strong>。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/villager-names/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"120\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于难以判断已命名村民的职业：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/villager-names/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1033\" height=\"600\"></strong><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组也会在交易界面中添加职业信息：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/villager-names/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"958\" height=\"557\"></strong></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有多种命令可用于移除、分配或重新命名已加载村民的名称：</span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/villager-names/e.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组，只要下载源仍托管于 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何内容，请访问我们的&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
